// ---- pedersen_scalar_mul_256: chunked 256-round double-and-add --------
// Phase 4 of the Pedersen build. Chains 8 calls to the verified
// pedersen_scalar_mul_32 (each processing one u32 limb of the scalar),
// MSB-first across limbs 7..0.
//
// Why chunked: phase 2's direct 248-round unroll hit a Z3 timeout at
// 3000s because each chained pedersen_step calls curve(running)
// precondition required Z3 to substitute through the curve polynomial
// 248 times in one query. The chunked wrapper splits this into 8
// function-call boundaries, each with a cheap local precondition
