// ---- pedersen_demo: 2-scalar Pedersen-style hash with 32-bit chunks ----
// Demonstrates the full Pedersen composition: 2 scalar muls + 2 ec_adds.
// Production Stark Pedersen splits each 252-bit input into 248-bit-low +
// 4-bit-high and runs 4 scalar muls. This demo uses 32-bit scalars to
// stay within the verified pedersen_scalar_mul_32 helpers envelope.
//
// Output is the (x, y) of P0_shift + a*P1 + b*P3 in Mont form, guaranteed
// on the curve.

